Bind Npc 31568 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31567 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 771 "[Lemegeton] Isolation method"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Malraseu."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Pelore."

Requires (player level >= 75 and player is karus and quest 769 is completed) or (player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 770 is completed)

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "master! I think the war has ended. Since Malraseu is looking for you let's go visit [Eslant]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! I think the war has ended. Since Pellore is looking for you let's go visit [Eslant]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hello! I've heard that <Selfname> has been great at the battle. Thank you."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Order of the Sorcery] Bros will teach you isolation? I haven't heard about that.\n\nTheir souls are sealed with the rings but we can't say that the rings power is complete.\n\nYou need to speak to Malraseu, the [Order of the Sorcery Leader] of Eslant."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh, hello? I've heard that you've done an awesome job at the battle. Thank you so much."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Order of the Sorcery] Seis will teach you isolation? I haven't heard about that.\n\nTheir souls are sealed with the rings but we can't say that the rings power is complete.\n\nYou need to speak to Phelor, the [Order of the Sorcery Leader] of Eslant."

On claimable
    Show quest "First, we need materials to make the [Scroll of Seal]. Obtain [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon. Then, collect [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Krowaz territory. Come back once you've finished collecting all the materials."
